    "bookends": {
      "first": {
        "speaker": 25,
        "line": 2,
        "text": "I've worked on thousands of patients, all kinds - movie stars, charity cases. Never had a request like this. I did check with the Board. Medically, ethically, there was no reason not to comply. Your face your money. Well, I did the best I could from the photographs..."
      },
